\"/players/emerald/guard\",0,if it's something that i'll only use once or twice, i code it into the room:1,1,\"guard\",\"obj/monster\", ({  \"set_name\",\"guard\",    \"set_level\",2,  }),is this what you meant?how about mailing me the paths of the files you have questions about, andi'll take a look at them.  i'm not a computer person, but i know pretty muchhow to get a good room working.-E**honzo**To: blaargSubj: hey tristan Date: Aug 11hey tristan, Long time no hear from. How's everything? You're still around here?My brother and I are on our own mud now. If you want, come visit us.Mud address is: fate.mudservices.com 4000					Your old-roommate and friend,						Jack Tin**redsexy**To: blaargSubj: AdDate: Oct 22redsexy@geocities.com30 seconds to reboot.LuvSarah (with some news about Albany and visiting)**griffon**To: blaargSubj: if ya cant locate meDate: Nov  9try purple.cow.net 8888I'm on as Delaier Deliaand Realms as Kiraluv ya!**smurf**To: blaargSubj: your planDate: Jan  2I know it's a little late and probably no consolation, but i wanted to tell you Merry Christmas, and Happy New Year....a litle late.  My holidays were nuthin special of course.  New Year's was ok....went to the  bar for a party, and got pretty well hammered. But i was alone too...with many friends, but alone...I miss talking to you...write me!LoveMichelle**oscar**To: blaargSubj: Thanks sweetyCc: Date: Jan  5Do I use tristan@hornet.liunet.edu? You know I won't read your email...I just want to play that is all =)Talk to you laters...Kim**oscar**To: blaargSubj: ThanksDate: Jan  6Thanks for my own special acct. How were your holidays? I hope that everythingwas cool! Talk to you when you are on? Mail me soon! Love always,Kim**smurf**To: blaargSubj: hiDate: Jan 11you ignored my first message, or had nuthing to say to me but i wanted to write you and tell you that your palns have been.....well